---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The gr8s binary embeds the following third-party programs, each distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and each the copyright of its
respective authors. They are included unmodified. `gr8s notices` prints this
attribution together with every vendored dependency's full license text.

  containerd, containerd-shim-runc-v2
    Copyright The containerd Authors
    https://github.com/containerd/containerd

  runc
    Copyright The runc / Open Container Initiative Authors
    https://github.com/opencontainers/runc

  CNI plugins (bridge, host-local, loopback, firewall)
    Copyright The CNI Authors
    https://github.com/containernetworking/plugins

gr8s also links the system libzstd (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Meta Platforms,
Inc.; https://github.com/facebook/zstd) at runtime for `gr8s runtime install`.

Optional sandbox/microVM runtimes fetched by `gr8s runtime install` (gVisor,
Kata Containers; both Apache-2.0) are downloaded on demand and are not part
of this distribution.
